# T020 warning: Int and Float are disjoint types.
# First arm expects Float, but scrutinee is Int, so T020 is emitted.
# At runtime the first arm doesn't match, second arm fires.
[match 42
  [case [let f@Float] [str "float " f]]
  [case [let n@Int] [str "int " n]]]
=== out
String("int 42")
=== warn
dead match arm — pattern type `Float` is disjoint from scrutinee type `IntLiteral(42)`
